olor="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">Connect</h2><div display="inline-block" cursor="help" data-cy="tooltip-trigger" class="sc-5062b090-2 bPxdsG"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="18" width="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" color="#76777A" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 cyQuJj"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="16" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="8" y2="8"></line></svg></div></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 frKAFo wSTCA"><p color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-b1a93422-3 byZndi fmgVAn">Let’s get the ball rolling!</p></div></div><section id="section-updates" data-cy="section-updates" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 czvsjw"><h2 font-size="20px,24px,32px" color="black.700" font-weight="normal" class="sc-1709896-0 NVTKe">News from Mocha</h2><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iVvBqZ hvfLzF"><p color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-7234a878-1 eEeoYU blMYZB">Updates on our activities and progress.</p></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 hncGsq"><div class="sc-2c35d607-0 fURMss"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 CaGOk"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Mark Wiemer" class="hover:underline" href="/mark-wiemer"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/mark-wiemer/03f22b8/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/mark-wiemer/03f22b8/avatar.png?height=80" title="Mark Wiemer" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/mochajs/updates/community-contributions"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">2026 Community Sponsorships</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 iHtJvF">Today, we are happy to announce that Mocha will be donating $5,000 each to four different community projects, for a total of $20,000 donated to the modern JavaScript community. This works to match our...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 djgaXq" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/mochajs/updates/community-contributions">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on July 24, 2026 by <a title="Mark Wiemer" class="hover:underline" href="/mark-wiemer">Mark Wiemer</a></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 CaGOk"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Pelle Wessman" class="hover:underline" href="/voxpelli"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/voxpelli/4e0eeb6/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/voxpelli/4e0eeb6/avatar.png?height=80" title="Pelle Wessman" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/mochajs/updates/adopting-collective-funds-guidelines-0-1"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">Adopting Collective Funds Guidelines 0.1</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 iHtJvF">The Mocha project has adopted the newly created <a href="https://github.com/collective-funds/guidelines">Collective Funds Guidelines 0.1</a>, that it was part in creating, and will going forward apply these best practices to ensure that mai...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 djgaXq" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/mochajs/updates/adopting-collective-funds-guidelines-0-1">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on August 22, 2024 by <a title="Pelle Wessman" class="hover:underline" href="/voxpelli">Pelle Wessman</a></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bKpiA-d"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jzMvMa csvMWi"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 qIesT"><a title="Christopher Hiller" class="hover:underline" href="/boneskull"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/boneskull/9ece91b/avatar.png?height=80);background-size:cover" size="40" type="INDIVIDUAL" src="https://images.opencollective.com/boneskull/9ece91b/avatar.png?height=80" title="Christopher Hiller" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 jFejKr fGEJMP sc-ff045f41-0 fEQhME"></div></a></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 giVqMW eDZLcq"><a href="/mochajs/updates/presentation-intro-to-mocha"><p color="black.900" font-weight="600" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 hAeQmn">Presentation: Intro to Mocha</p></a><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 dgVncz"><div><div style="display:inline" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 iHtJvF">I gave an &quot;introduction to Mocha&quot; talk at <a href="https://opencollective.com/redirect?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpdxnode.org">PDXNode</a> on January 11, 2018. It features as few of (what I consider to be) &quot;best practices&quot; for using Mocha, so could b...</div></div> <a class="sc-7169fd69-0 djgaXq" font-size="12px" color="primary.500" href="/mochajs/updates/presentation-intro-to-mocha">Read more</a></div><div color="black.600" font-size="12px" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 ccmCzU">Published on March 5, 2018 by <a title="Christopher Hiller" class="hover:underline" href="/boneskull">Christopher Hiller</a></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/mochajs/updates"><button data-cy="view-all-updates-btn" width="1" font-size="14px" class="sc-532480db-0 fvwWQl">View all updates<!-- --> →</button></a></div></div></section><div id="category-ABOUT" class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-b1a93422-0 EBMGw bxETTS"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 fqoDra ferUGe"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 sc-b1a93422-2 htvGag faHCM qykBn"><img src="/static/images/collective-navigation/CollectiveNavbarIconAbout.png" alt="" class="sc-b1a93422-1 dWuXCV"/></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kelEPL fHSAwH"><h2 data-cy="category-ABOUT-title" font-size="32px" font-weight="normal" color="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">About</h2></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div></div><section id="section-about" data-cy="section-about" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 cIqaQH"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 eRmECd"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 jRaTqn"><div><div data-cy="longDescription" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 iHtJvF"><div>Mocha is a feature-rich JavaScript test framework running on Node.js and the browser, making asynchronous testing reliable and fun. Mocha tests run serially or in parallel, allowing for flexible and accurate reporting, while mapping uncaught exceptions to the correct test cases. <br/><br/></div><h3>Stats</h3><ul><li>Mocha is downloaded roughly 12M times per week <a href="https://opencollective.com/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npmjs.com%2Fpackage%2Fmocha">on NPM</a>.</li><li>The repo has more than 20k stars and 30k unique visitors per month.</li></ul><div><br/>Disclaimer: This Collective is run by and for the benefit of the independent contributors to the Mocha open source software project. This Collective is not endorsed or administered by the OpenJS Foundation; the OpenJS Foundation does not receive and has no control over any funds contributed; the OpenJS Foundation does not direct or otherwise supervise the actions of any contributor to the Mocha project; and all donations made will be expended for the private benefit of or otherwise to reimburse individuals that do not have an employer/employee, contractor, or other agency relationship with the OpenJS Foundation. The Mocha marks used herein are used under license from the OpenJS Foundation for the benefit of the open source software community.<br/><br/>Sponsoring Mocha does not guarantee ad placement on mochajs.org. The Mocha project reserves the right to restrict placement for any reason, including, but not limited to, excluding obvious spam.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-our-team" data-cy="section-our-team" class="sc-3340244f-0 eGKBUl"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 jyulmr"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 uzGKt"><h2 font-weight="500" color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-5 kmgLsS">Our team</h2><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bGxwtX"><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/mark-wiemer"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/mark-wiemer/03f22b8/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/mark-wiemer/03f22b8/avatar.png" title="Mark Wiemer" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a href="/mark-wiemer"><p color="black.900" font-weight="500" title="Mark Wiemer" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 boFGUd">Mark Wiemer</p></a><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 gmTaiH"><div class="sc-afa001f2-0 fZtaHx sc-d82cae7-4 kJsbDm">Admin</div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 eVvpCT"><q title="Here to help!" class="sc-d82cae7-2 jEuHIG">Here to help!</q></div></div></div><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/joshuakgoldberg"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/joshuakgoldberg/fec312c/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/joshuakgoldberg/fec312c/avatar.png" title="Josh Goldberg" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cs